<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About Us - DuaAjan</title>

    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        *{
            margin:0;
            padding:0;
            box-sizing:border-box;
            font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;
        }

        body{
            background:#f8fafc;
            color:#1e293b;
        }

        .navbar{
            background:#0f766e;
            color:white;
            padding:18px 40px;
        }

        .navbar h2{
            font-size:24px;
        }

        .hero{
            background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f766e,#115e59);
            color:white;
            text-align:center;
            padding:80px 20px;
        }

        .hero h1{
            font-size:48px;
            margin-bottom:15px;
        }

        .hero p{
            max-width:700px;
            margin:auto;
            font-size:18px;
            opacity:.95;
        }

        .container{
            max-width:1200px;
            margin:auto;
            padding:60px 20px;
        }

        .section{
            margin-bottom:60px;
        }

        .section h2{
            margin-bottom:20px;
            color:#0f766e;
        }

        .section p{
            line-height:1.8;
            color:#475569;
        }

        .cards{
            display:grid;
            grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));
            gap:25px;
            margin-top:30px;
        }

        .card{
            background:white;
            padding:25px;
            border-radius:15px;
            box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.06);
        }

        .card h3{
            margin-bottom:10px;
            color:#0f766e;
        }

        .footer{
            background:#0f172a;
            color:white;
            text-align:center;
            padding:20px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="navbar">
    <h2>DuaAjan</h2>
</div>

<section class="hero">
    <h1>About DuaAjan</h1>

    <p>
        Connecting mosques and communities through real-time
        Azaan broadcasts, making it easier for everyone to stay
        connected with prayer times from anywhere.
    </p>
</section>

<div class="container">

    <div class="section">
        <h2>Who We Are</h2>

        <p>
            DuaAjan is a modern digital platform designed to help
            mosques broadcast live Azaan and important announcements
            directly to listeners. Our mission is to bridge the gap
            between mosques and communities through reliable and
            accessible technology.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>Our Mission</h2>

        <p>
            We aim to provide a simple and powerful solution that
            enables people to listen to live Azaan from their local
            mosque anytime and anywhere. By using modern streaming
            technology, we help strengthen community connections and
            improve accessibility.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>Why Choose DuaAjan?</h2>

        <div class="cards">

            <div class="card">
                <h3>🔊 Live Broadcast</h3>
                <p>
                    Real-time audio broadcasting from mosques with
                    minimal delay.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h3>📱 Mobile Friendly</h3>
                <p>
                    Listen from your smartphone anytime and anywhere.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h3>🔔 Smart Notifications</h3>
                <p>
                    Receive instant alerts when a live broadcast starts.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h3>🕌 Community Focused</h3>
                <p>
                    Designed specifically for mosques and their communities.
                </p>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>

</div>

<footer class="footer">
    © 2026 DuaAjan. All Rights Reserved.
</footer>

</body>
</html>